   "about": "•As a product manager, I bridge the gap between customer needs and technology solutions.\n\n•I graduated from Georgia Tech with Bachelor's and Master's degrees in electrical engineering.\n\n•I have functional experience in product management, project management, market insights & activation, and stakeholder management.\n\n•I have technical experience with digital signal processing, frontend development, machine learning, genAI, information theory, data compression, and embedded devices. My coding languages of choice are C/C++, React, and MATLAB, and I am always eager to learn a new language!\n\n•I have a passion for diversity. I was president of Women in ECE at Georgia Tech, I received the Helen E. Grenga Award for creating an inclusive environment, and I founded the early career SWE onboarding program at Deloitte.",
